<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">-Arum Bibleh Translation</book>
  <para style="h">2 Korintiyawa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Amgbasho Ablusu ata afri a na na Korintiyawa mboh</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Korintiyawa</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 kor.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Korintiyawa</para>
  <para style="imt">TSANA IKPI TSIFA</para>
  <para style="im">Ata areh a bu amgbasho Ablusu ata afri a na ni kyangwri Korintiyawa mboh.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Amgbasho ata areh anyi na amya, Ablusu. Nnoh a seh meh la meh ti bu kyangwri bleh tsifa nana Yeso Kristi na kira a ŋoh. Tasa atsi ambohroh Timoti za a yama na amya atsi leh ŋa ba nnoh reh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 1:1">Mya meh tohmoh amgbasho ata areh ba nnoh mohnoh amboh tufa mboh nza ni yama nnoh ma Korinti, tasa amboh tufa yehlehleh nza ma a yama ma Akaya:<verse eid="2CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />Lisa alindeh Nnoh tasa tuma alindeh ta a bu na amohnoh anyi na Ada ambohroh tasa Ada ambohroh Yeso Kristi.<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nnoh Ata Nga Soh ivoh Yira Nambri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />Mbohroh meh riri Nnoh, ŋoh nza bu Ada ata Ada ambohroh Yeso Kristi, Ada ata nza a bu na kwini gaga tasa za a bu Nnoh ata ka nga reh soh ivoh yira nambri, <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />ŋoh ata nza ka nga reh soh ivoh yira nambri nimeh iya ambohroh mboh, la mbohroh za meh ti nga soh ivoh yira ma mgbiri amboh ata ma a leh a wa iya na soh ivoh yira ata mbohroh nza meh sa nyi na Nnoh reh. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Tswanza mbohroh nza meh leh wa iya ika ata Kristi na ikpi a ŋoh ta ka a wa reh, ma aki wohroh za ma a nati nga reh soh ivoh yira nimeh Kristi gaga. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Ha mbohroh meh wa iya, a bu tsifa la mohnoh ti hunji noh soh ivoh yira tasa nvara, nza Nnoh nga reh soh ivoh yira, wohroh a nati a shingi reh timi nga nnoh soh ivoh yira za, ata ni nati de noh ikpi ahroh nimeh iya ata ni leh wa nnoh reh. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Gya agohsoh ambohroh na amohnoh a wuwana alindeh, la mbohroh meh wina la tswanza nza ni leh wa nnoh iya biroh ika ata ambohroh reh, dehreh za ni nati hunji noh biroh soh ivoh yira ata meh leh hunji reh.<verse eid="2CO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />ambohroh mboh, a zohhoh ti wina noh biroh iya ata ti kǝ leh wa nnoh ma Akpo afiya Asiya reh. Iya reh tana bu gaga veve kpeh, mbohroh timi gu la meh nati nvara kpeh. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Mbohroh za timi gu ma agohsoh ambohroh la ma a ka shimba reh akpi kwo. Ata areh neh a bu dehreh la mbohroh timi kama gya agohsoh ambohroh na wina ata ikpi ambohroh kpeh, mbohroh neh timi gya agohsoh ambohroh na ni Nnoh, ŋoh ata ka a yiri amboh kwo mboh. <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />Nnoh a sa reh a hwana anyi na abibi kwo ata nza a nati a lofo reh nambri reh, tasa za a nati a sa reh a hwana. Mbohroh meh gya agohsoh ambohroh na a ŋoh la a nati a gyuru a sa reh a hwana, <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />shingi turoh kwere Nnoh. La ma aki wohroh kyangwri mboh ma a nati kwende ma Nnoh tsifa ambohroh, tsifa ata nza ma a te reh atoh, tama a sa kwere ambohroh gaga reh.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ablusu A gyuru A sehneh Agohsoh A ŋoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />Va ivoh ma agohsoh ambohroh a bu tsifa la kohnoh ata agohsoh ambohroh a nza a bleh reh la meh tuma ma inziyo na agohsoh fyafya tasa na agohsoh anyimbehreh, ma ikpi tuma ata meh tuma mbohroh ma amohnoh. Meh bleh la meh lisa dehreh nimeh zizi ata agohsoh Nnoh. Mbohroh meh lisa dehreh tsifa lomo ata inziyo areh kpeh, mbohroh neh meh lisa dehreh la tsifa andromboh alindeh Nnoh nza a lisa reh. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" />Mbohroh meh sohroh ŋa nnoh andromboh ata ni nati sohroh wina bleh nza ti wina noh kpeh, meh gya agohsoh la ni nati wina noh nambri, <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" />tswanza mohnoh nza ni wina turoh shidi ma reh, ni tre ba ti sehreh ti wina noh gaga la ni nati wina va nnoh ivoh ma agohsoh na ambohroh tswanza mbohroh za meh nati wina va ivoh ma agohsoh na amohnoh ibi ata Ada Yeso Kristi nza a nati a gyuru a ba reh.<verse eid="2CO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Tsifa la meh gya agohsoh na ata areh, meh bu na kohnoh la meh ti jiji ba na amohnoh, la mata a te nnoh atoh lo afri. <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />Kohnoh amya la meh ti ba nnoh sehneh nza meh nati na Makidoniya reh, tasa meh ti gyuru ba na amohnoh za nza meh nati ta Makidoniya reh, la ti shingi meh noh nza meh nati na Yahudiya reh. <verse eid="2CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Meh ti kǝ bleh gya la meh nati lisa dehreh reh, meh wina andromboh ata mya nza ni leh lisa reh kpeh? Ha ni nza noh la lisa bana amya reh a bu ata kohnoh kyangwri la meh ti bleh la, &lt;&lt;Haa&gt;&gt;tasa za meh ti gyuru bleh la &lt;&lt;Uwa&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Tswanza Nnoh neh nza ka a bu zizi reh, tsifa ambohroh na amohnoh reh a bu ata la &lt;&lt;Haa&gt;&gt; tasa &lt;&lt;Uwa&gt;&gt; kpeh. <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />Tsifa Amehreh Nnoh, Yeso Kristi, ata Sila tasa Timoti mboh tama ka ahwra tsifa a ŋoh a bleh noh reh, tana bu ata&lt;&lt;Haa&gt;&gt; tasa &lt;&lt;Uwa&gt;&gt; kpeh, nimeh tsifa a ŋoh reh neh a ka bu &lt;&lt;Haa&gt;&gt; ni tutu ma. <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />Awumu mboh reh nambri ata Nnoh ka a bleh a gya reh ka a su la&lt;&lt;Haa&gt;&gt; tsifa Kristi. Nimeh sa a ŋoh za neh mbohroh meh kǝ bleh la &lt;&lt;Avoh dehreh&gt;&gt; la timi nga Nnoh Agba. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />nehnehreh a bu Nnoh nza a de reh mbohroh ma amohnoh timi shi wuwana nimeh Kristi. A gyuru a seh reh za la timi bu ahwra a ŋoh mboh, <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />a gya reh kpra ata nza a nati a tsana la mbohroh meh bu a ŋoh mboh, a gyuru nga reh huru a ŋoh za were nimeh agohsoh ambohroh mboh, huru reh a nati a tsana reh timi wina andromboh ata meh nati wina sa nyi na Nnoh reh.<verse eid="2CO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Nnoh a wina la tsifa reh a bu zizi, tsifa la meh kira ti wa nnoh iya gaga kpeh, nza a gyuru a ha meh na Korinti reh. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />Mbohroh meh kira meh ti tsana noh wuwana ma ikpi nga agohsoh amohnoh kpeh, mbohroh neh meh te ndohmoh na amohnoh tsifa johjoh amohnoh, tsifa la ni shi wuwana nnoh nimeh nga agohsoh amohnoh.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Mya meh gu ma agohsoh amya la, meh nati za gyuru ba nnoh sene ata nza a nati a de hungwa yira a ba nnoh za kpeh. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Nza meh de hungwa yira ba nnoh, a bu anyi ata nza a nati a nga meh nana agohsoh reh, ha a bu ŋoh ata mya nza ni kputu ŋoh reh kpeh? <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Tsifa ata meh ti kǝ ŋa amgbasho ata ari ba nnoh reh, meh kira la nza meh ba na amohnoh reh ti kama kputu meh noh agohsoh kpeh, mohnoh neh ti nga meh noh nana agohsoh. Meh gya agohsoh amya na amohnoh nambri, la nana agohsoh amya a bu amohnoh nambri za. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />Meh ti kǝ ŋa amgbasho ba nnoh reh, meh tini bu nimeh iya agba tasa hungwa agohsoh gaga, tasa mwueneh za gaga, a bu tsifa la ti bu noh na hungwa agohsoh kpeh, mya neh meh kira ti wina noh la meh kira na amohnoh gaga.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Te Kohro Ma Kyangwri Ata Nza A lisa Andromboh Abibi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Nza akyo anyi a de kputu agohsoh a ba ma kyangwri mboh, a lisa meh mya tsimiya kpeh, ma aki anyi neh meh nati bleh la a lisa reh nambri ma ambohroh, meh bleh tsifa reh la meh ti fla nnoh kpeh. <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Iya ata vara kyangwri ma a nati nga ŋoh reh a nati a tswa ŋoh. <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />Nehnehreh a nati a zohhoh ti te nnoh kohhroh na a ŋoh ti gyuru nga nnoh wuwa agohsoh za, la hungwa yira agba ta a kama a de ŋoh kpeh. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />Nza a bu dehreh, meh kwere nnoh ti bleh noh shimba la ni kira nnoh na a ŋoh gaga. <verse eid="2CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />Meh ŋa amgbasho ata areh ba nnoh la meh ti tsara nnoh nza, meh ti nza ha ni nati tufa nnoh akeki amya mboh reh nambri. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Nza ni te nnoh kohhroh na kpakpana akyo, meh nati te kohhroh na kpakpana a ŋoh za. Nza andromboh ata meh nati gu te kohhroh a yama reh, meh gu te kohhroh tsifa amohnoh nimeh sa Kristi, <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />la agugu ta kama a hunji aki a landa reh kpeh, tsifa la mbohroh meh wina akeki a ŋoh mboh reh nambri.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndohmoh Ablusu Ma Taruwasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />Mya meh ba akpo afiya Taruwasa atsi bleh tsifa nana Kristi reh, Ada a vuru meh aki la meh ti te ndohmoh ata areh, <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />agohsoh amya neh a kukuna kpeh tsifa la meh sohroh nza atsi amya Titus ma a huru kpeh. Meh kǝ bleh mboh la ibi anyi fya, meh kǝ na amya Makidoniya.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Mya neh meh kwende ma Nnoh, ŋoh ata nza ka a leh a shingi reh na tutu meh ti leh rya tohmoh nimeh sa Kristi, a te ndohmoh na ambohroh la meh ti de tohmoh Kristi reh tre atsifi a tswanza amehneh ata ka a fi angǝshi alindeh reh. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />Mbohroh reh meh tswanza amehneh ata ka a fi angǝshi alindeh ata Kristi nza a nga ma Nnoh reh, wohroh nza a treh atsifi nimeh amboh ata nza ma a nati a hunji nvara amoh tasa amboh ata ma bu ma aki lofona. <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />amboh ata nza ma a bu ma aki lofona reh, angǝshi reh a bu ata kwo, na amboh ata nza ma a nati a hunji nvara reh, a bu angǝshi fene a nati a de fene a ba mboh. <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Mbohroh reh meh tswanza mgbiri kyangwri mboh reh kpeh, amboh ata nza ma a leh ahwra tsifa Nnoh a bleh la mata a hunji firoh. Waa, a bu Nnoh na ikpi a ŋoh a tohmoh reh. Mbohroh meh leh tsifa na agohsoh anyimbehreh ma tohmoh Nnoh, meh tsifa tswanza Mbohroh amboh ata Nnoh a tohmoh reh.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />Meh nati gyuru ringa ikpi ambohroh za? ha meh buti fa amgbasho tsana ikpi a ba na amohnoh, ha nyi na amohnoh, tswanza mgbiri kyangwri mboh nza maka a lisa reh? <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />mohnoh na ikpi amohnoh ni bu noh tswanza amgbasho ambohroh, ata nza ma a ŋa nimeh agohsoh ambohroh, la kyangwri mboh nambri mata a nza tasa za mata a bleh a nza. <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />mohnoh ni tsana noh la ni bu noh tswanza amgbasho ata nza anyi na Kristi, ata nza bu ivoh ndohmoh ambohroh reh, ma a sohroh a ŋa na amwo akloh ŋa kpeh, ŋa reh neh a bu na huru zanana Nnoh ata nza a bu na fene, ma a kama a ŋa ma ikpi kpakpa ŋa kpeh, ŋa reh neh a bu ma agohsoh kyangwri mboh.<verse eid="2CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />biroh wuwa agohsoh ika ata areh a bu ambohroh ma aki Kristi ma tohmoh Nnoh. <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Mbohroh meh sohroh bu na andromboh ata meh nati tsana la meh leh te ndohmoh reh na wuwana ambohroh kpeh, wina ambohroh reh anyi na Nnoh. <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />A bu ŋoh nza a de reh meh ti bu amboh te ndohmoh ata bleh tsifa afeh gya reh, a bu ata amgbasho reh kpeh, neh ka a bu ata huru, akpi nza ma a ŋa a gya ma amgbasho reh, a bu wohroh a nati a de kwo ba, huru neh a nati a de fene a ba.<verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zoho Ata Bleh Tsifa Afeh Gya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Ma a tsana ndohmoh akpi, ata nza a ba ma trina reh a bu kwo, ma a ŋa ma ikpi kpakpa. Ma a tsana ndohmoh ata areh na zohhoh Nnoh, Israilawa mboh ma za a wina nza tohmoh Musa za kpeh la zana a ŋoh a bu gaga veve kpeh, wohroh reh a nati a trina. <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />Ndohmoh ata huru reh ma a keh zohhoh gaga kpeh? <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Nza ndohmoh ata nza a nati a lofo kyangwri mboh reh a zohhoh, a bu zizi la andromboh ata nza a nati a de reh meh ti hunji tufa yehlehleh ata Nnoh reh, a keh zohhoh. <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />meh ti bleh noh shimba, andromboh ata ta ka a zohhoh na kpikpi reh, a za a zohhoh nehnehreh za kpeh. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Nza andromboh ata nza a nati a trina reh a ba na zohhoh, a nati ka bu lele na andromboh ata nza a nati a tuma atono reh!<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Tsifa la Mbohroh meh bu na gya agohsoh na agbugba awumu amboh ata areh, a bu wohroh Mbohroh nza meh bu na wuwa agohsoh gaga reh. <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />Mbohroh meh tswanza Musa reh kpeh, ata ka a hama tohmoh a ŋoh na lefe reh, la Israila mboh mata a kama a nza zohhoh andromboh ata nza a nati a trina reh kpeh. <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Agohsoh amoh mboh neh a hamana, a gu a ba ba a te nehnehreh, andromboh anyi a leh a hama tsifa a zizi reh, nza ma a leh a bleh mboh tsifa bleh gya ata atono reh. Lefe reh a treh fya ma a hehreh a hingre kpeh, la ma a wina hingre kpeh, a bu Kristi ŋoh tsene ma a nati a wina hingre lefe reh. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />A gu a ba ba a te andrehmeh areh, nza ma a leh a bleh amgbasho Musa reh, azehneh reh ka a hama agohsoh amoh mboh. <verse eid="2CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />Nza akyo ata nza a ba na Ada neh, ma a nati a wina hingre lefe reh. <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Nehnehreh, a bu Ada ma nza bu huru reh, atsi ata huru Ada nza a yama reh, kyangwri ma a nati a tuma kpi amoh. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Mbohroh amboh ata nza ma a hama tohmoh ambohroh mboh kpeh reh, meh leh tsana zohhoh Ada reh tswanza amadubi, tasa za ma a sehneh reh meh ti bu tswanza ŋoh reh. Sene ata nza ma a leh a sehneh reh reh, a leh a bu gaga nimeh zohhoh ata nza anyi na Ada reh, wohroh nza bu huru reh.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="s">Asabara Ata Huru Nimeh Azo lu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />Nza a bu dehreh Nnoh nimeh kwini a ŋoh, nga reh ndohmoh ata areh la meh ti te, meh nati wina gu agohsoh ambohroh gya kate kpeh. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />Mbohroh meh fira tsifa ata ayuhu tasa ata nga sa gya na nda. Mbohroh meh leke meh ti bleh tsifa ata huru tsifa na sa Nnoh. Mbohroh neh meh leh bleh tsifa ata a zizi ma inziyo. Ma aki wohroh kyangwri mboh reh ma a nati a wina bleh tsifa ata a zizi ma ikpi ambohroh ma tohmoh Nnoh nimeh agohsoh amoh mboh. <verse eid="2CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Nza tsifa nana ata mbohroh nza meh leh bleh a bu ma huho reh, a bu na amboh ata nza ma a bu ma aki agugu nza ma a huho mboh reh. <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />Agugu ata nza bu noh ata ameh ata areh kǝ hama agohsoh amboh ata nza ma a kira kpeh reh, la mata a kama a nza zana ata tsifa nana nza a bu nimeh zohhoh Kristi reh kpeh, ata nza bu yafa Nnoh reh. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />A bu tsifa ikpi ambohroh meh leh hwra bleh kpeh, tsifa reh neh a bu ata Yeso Kristi a ŋoh, la ŋoh a bu Ada, mbohroh reh meh tswanza ahwra amohnoh mboh tsifa Yeso. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />A bu Nnoh a bleh la,&lt;&lt;Zana ta a kate anyi nimeh shini ta a zana atsifi,&gt;&gt; wohroh reh ta a zana agohsoh ambohroh mboh la ta a zana kyangwri mboh mata a nza zohhoh Nnoh ma tohmoh Yeso Kristi.<verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />Dehreh za neh, mbohroh nza meh bu na asabara ata huru reh, meh tswanza azo lu reh. Meh bu dehreh la mata a tsana la wuwana ata nza a keh mgbiri mboh reh anyi na Nnoh mi, anyi na ambohroh kpeh. <verse eid="2CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />Ma leh nga reh iya mboh reh ma atsetse, mboh neh ma a wina ha reh bleh tsifa Yeso Kristi reh kpeh, ichi anyi meh kǝ la meh ti gya agohsoh kpeh, mbohroh neh meh kǝ gu agohsoh ambohroh kate kpeh, <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />kyangwri ma a leh nga reh iya, Nnoh neh a sohroh ata reh mbohroh tsimbohro kpeh, ichi anyi za maka a mla reh a were ma inzi, mboh neh maka a wina mla reh kwo kpeh. <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />Mbohroh meh bu ma aki kwo tswanza Yeso reh na tutu, la kyangwri mata a nza ndohmoh alindeh ata Yeso nza a lisa reh ma itoh ambohroh. <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />Mbohroh amboh ata nza meh bu na fene reh, meh bu ma aki kwo, tsifa la meh leh bleh tsifa Yeso, la mata a nza ndohmoh alindeh Yeso ma itoh ambohroh ata nza a bu itoh kwo reh. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />A bu tsifa wohroh mbohroh meh nati kwo tsifa amohnoh, la ti hunji noh fene.<verse eid="2CO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />Ma a ŋa a gya la, &lt;&lt;Mya meh nga agohsoh; a bu tsifa wohroh mya nza ni tsifa reh,&gt;&gt;Na biroh huru ata nga agohsoh ika ata wohroh reh, mbohroh za meh kira, nza a bu dehreh mbohroh za meh tsifa, <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />mbohroh meh wina za la Nnoh ata nza a yiri Ada Kristi anyi ma kwo reh, a nati a yiri reh za mbohroh ma Yeso, Nnoh reh a nati a de reh a ba ma akpo anyimbehreh mbohroh ma amohnoh, meh ti bu na a ŋoh. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />amboh areh nambri a bu ata a nati a shingi nnoh reh, Nnoh a leh a tsana ma mgbiri kyangwri mboh za la ŋoh wa a kira na amoh, la meh ti nga Nnoh agba.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />Nza a bu dehreh, a sohroh aniye reh amgbasho kpeh, itoh ambohroh reh a buti te abibi, dehreh za na tutu ma a leh a de huru ambohroh reh a te afeh ŋoh. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Nza ameh iya ata mbohroh meh leh wa reh a nati a yanda kpeh, a nati a mara reh awumu amboh ata ma a zohhoh gaga, ta a tuma reh atono. <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />A bu awumu ata iyo nza a nza mbohroh meh leh nza kpeh, mbohroh neh meh gyuru leh nza ata iyo a nati a wina nza kpeh, awumu ata maka a nza reh, a bu amboh ata ma a nati a yanda kpeh, amboh ata ma a nati a wina nza kpeh reh, ma a nati a tuma atono.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="s1">Atsi Tuma ambohroh ma Inza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Ni wina noh la nza ma a druhu afiya ambohroh ata areh nza meh tuma nimeh reh, meh bleh itoh ambohroh ata inziyo ata areh, Nnoh na ikpi a ŋoh a lisa reh afiya ma inza. afiya reh a bu kyangwri a mina kpeh, za a nati tuma atono. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />nehnehreh neh meh shimba fene, meh buti kya iyo gaga meh ti hunji itoh ata areh ata nza ma a nati were reh ma inza reh. <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />Nza Nnoh tana a jimi reh na kuri wohroh reh, ma a nati a za a nza reh na mgbimgbi kpeh. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Nza meh buti tuma nimeh itoh ata areh ata inziyo reh meh buti ti goh tsifa la ma a fla reh. A bu la meh kira la meh ti gafa na na itoh ambohroh ata inziyo kpeh, neh meh kira la mata a jimi reh na ata inza a ŋoh, tsifa la andromboh ata a bu na fene ata tuma atono ta a sehneh andromboh ata nza ka a kwo hwana anyimbehreh. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Nnoh na ikpi a ŋoh nza lisa reh sehnehna ata areh, ta ka nga reh huru a ŋoh la ta a shi a nza andromboh ata nza a nati a lisa reh ma tohmoh. <verse eid="2CO 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Bu dehreh nza meh bu na wuwa agohsoh, meh wina za la nza meh bu na itoh ata areh ata inziyo, meh bu gbugba na afiya ambohroh ata nza a bu na Ada reh. <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />Meh hende na gya agohsoh, a bu ata nza iyo kpeh. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />Meh bu na wuwa agohsoh, tasa meh keh kira meh ti ta itoh ata areh ata inziyo, meh ti tuma na Ada ma inza. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />A keh awumu mboh na agba ma, meh keh kira ŋoh ta a nza nana ambohroh, ha meh bu ma inziyo areh ha meh bu ma inza. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" />A bu tsifa wohroh reh ŋa nambri ma ambohroh meh ti shi ma tohmoh Kristi kanga, la ta ahwra reh akpi. Ha ni bu anyi ni nati sa firoh ndohmoh ata nza ni lisa ma itoh ata areh ata inziyo, ha bu alindeh ha bu abibi.<verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lisa Kyangwri Mboh Mata Suhruna Na Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Nyi na ameh wohroh, meh wina la ka bu mboh a bu nyiri Nnoh, meh kira meh ti lende kyangwri mboh. Nnoh a wina nza meh a yama nambri, tasa meh gya la ni wina noh ata areh ma agohsoh amohnoh. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />A sohroh bu la meh kira meh ti ringa ikpi ambohroh ma tohmoh amohnoh kpeh, meh kpakpatana meh ti bleh noh ila alindeh ata ti nza noh nana ambohroh, la ti wina nga noh kira ma amboh nza maka a gu ikpi amoh a ka tsifa kpra amoh mboh, a bu agohsoh amoh kpeh. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Meh te a kwere, tswanza mgbiri nza maka a bleh reh? ha meh te a kwere, meh te tsifa la meh ti gu sa Nnoh ka. nza neh meh te a kwere kpeh, areh a bu tsifa amohnoh. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Ha bu mboh meh kǝ lisa, meh lisa bu tsifa la meh ti hunji firoh kpeh, meh lisa neh tsifa Kristi nza ka a shi reh reh. tswanza nza meh nga agohsoh Kristi a kwo tsifa ma ikpi kyangwri mboh nambri, nza a bu dehreh nambri ma a kwo ma a ŋoh. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />Tasa a kwo tsifa ambohroh nambri, la amboh nza ma a bu na fene mata a za a fene ata ikpi amoh kpeh, mata a fene tsifa a ŋoh ata nza a kwo tsifa amoh tasa maka a yiri ŋoh tsifa amoh. <verse eid="2CO 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Dehreh za, nyi nehnehreh a na tohmoh meh za nati nza akyo tsifa la ma a bu kyangwri tswanza Mbohroh kpeh. Timi jiji wina Kristi tswanza ŋoh a bu kyangwri, neh meh za wina ŋoh tswanza ika wohroh za kpeh <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />Nza a bu dehreh akyo ata nza a bu nimeh Kristi, ŋoh a bu kyangwri afeh; agohsoh atono reh kǝ na a ŋoh, agohsoh afeh reh kǝ ba! <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Areh nambri anyi na Nnoh, ata nza a suhru reh a ba ma ikpi a ŋoh ma aki Kristi tasa: ta ka a nga reh dohsohna suhruna <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />La Nnoh tana suhru inziyo reh a ba na a ŋoh nimeh Kristi, la a bu tsifa la ŋoh ta a leh a bleh kpakpana ma ikpi kyangwri mboh kpeh. Tasa ŋoh kǝ gya reh tohmoh ata suhruna. <verse eid="2CO 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />A bu dehreh, meh tsifa aniye na Kristi. A tswanza a bu Nnoh na ikpi a ŋoh a buti tsifa na amohnoh ma aki ambohroh. Meh kwere nnoh nimeh isa Kristi ti suhruna nnoh na Nnoh, ti bu noh ziza a ŋoh mboh, ti sohroh bu noh amboh ata nza ma fi ŋoh ma tohmoh kpeh. <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Kristi kǝ hehreh kpakpana nza kpeh, la a bu tsifa ambohroh Nnoh a de ŋoh a te tswanza kyangwri kpakpana. A bu tsifa wohroh, meh nati wina hunji Nnoh ta lisa reh meh ti tufa yehlehleh.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Mbohroh nza meh bu iziza te ndohmoh Nnoh reh, Meh buti kwere nnoh mohnoh Nnoh nza a lisa nnoh alindeh, kama ta nnoh ta a bu wusu kpeh. <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />A bu ŋa gya la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">&lt;&lt;Na ameh lisa alindeh amya meh sere nnoh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:2">tasa ma ibi nvara meh shingi nnoh.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:2">Meh bleh noh, nehnehreh a bu ameh ata Nnoh ta a lisa reh, nehnehreh a bu ibi ata hunji nvara.<verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wa Iya Ablusu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />Meh hende ma aki ata nza a nati de akyo ta a kpa hwana kpeh tsifa ambohroh, tasa akyo a nati hunji ta a kya reh ma aki tufa ambohroh reh kpeh. <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />Nimeh andromboh nza meh kǝ lisa nambri neh, meh tsana la meh bu a zizi amboh tufa Nnoh mboh. Meh soh ivoh yira meh ti de ikpi ahroh wuwa nyi na fa akpi mboh tasa iya mboh ata hinga agohsoh ha a bu ika atamaa; <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />tama a mla reh, ma a de reh a ka ma ida ka, amboh kǝ de agohsoh ambohroh ka a hinga reh nimeh wa iya ambohroh dehreh ma, meh kǝ hunji leh mla kpeh, tasa inyo agba; <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />Meh tsana ikpi ambohroh la nimeh zanana ambohroh, nimeh nza wina ambohroh, nimeh soh ivoh yira ambohroh, nimeh agohsoh alindeh ambohroh, na Huru zanana nza a bu nimeh ambohroh, tasa nimeh kira zizi ambohroh. <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />Nimeh hwra tsifa ata a zizi tasa nimeh wuwana ata Nnoh; na tsifa a zizi ata tufa yehlehleh tswanza awumu gofo nza meh de na mgba ivoh rya a kpa tasa na mgba ivoh a mina; <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />Ma a buti nga reh agba tasa ma a buti rina reh. ma a gu reh tswanza meh bu amboh landa kyangwri mboh, Mbohroh neh meh bu amboh bleh zizi mi. <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />Ma a gu reh a te kohhroh, tswanza ma a sohroh a wina kpeh reh. Meh tuma nda na kwo, Mbohroh neh meh tre bu na fene. ma mla reh neh meh sohroh kwo kpeh; <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />a rina reh ahroh dehreh, neh meh kǝ johjoh na tutu, meh bu iya ma, neh meh kǝ nga asabara huru ma amboh tswa; meh sohroh bu na andromboh kpeh, tasa meh bu na awumu mboh nambri. <verse eid="2CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />mohnoh Korintiya mboh, meh sohroh huho nnoh andromboh kpeh, tasa za meh tsana la meh kira na amohnoh gaga <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />A bu Mbohroh meh sohroh leke timi tsana kira na amohnoh kpeh, a bu mohnoh mi ni sohroh vuru nnoh agohsoh amohnoh mboh ti kira nnoh na ambohroh kpeh.<verse eid="2CO 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kama Bu Nnoh Tswanza amboh Nza ma a wina Nnoh Kpeh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />Meh tsifa na amohnoh tswanza ada nza ka atsifa na mara a ŋoh mboh, mohnoh za tsana turoh la ni kira nnoh na ambohroh. <verse eid="2CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />Kama dohsoh noh ikpi na amboh nza maka a tufa Ada kpeh. Kyangwri tufa yehlehleh a nati a wina tuma alindeh na kyangwri lisa abibi? ha la a ka bu umbo ka a dohsoh zana ma shini? <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Ni nza noh Yeso Kristi reh a bu iza agugu reh? Ha la ka bu mboh ka a dohdohsoh amboh tufa Nnoh mboh tasa amboh nza ma a tufa Nnoh kpeh? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" />A bu umbo ka a dohdohsoh amboh tufa mboh tasa amboh nza ma a wina Nnoh kpeh? Mbohroh meh tswanza ida Nnoh ata nza a bu na fene. Tswanza Nnoh na ikpi a ŋoh nza a bleh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">&lt;&lt;Meh nati lisa afiya amya na kyangwri amya mboh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">meh nati tuma na amoh;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">meh nati bu Nnoh amoh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">tasa ma a nati a bu kyangwri amya mboh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />&lt;&lt;Nza a bu dehreh kate nyi nnoh ma hohroh amboh nza ma a bu amboh tufa Nnoh mboh Kpeh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">kpi nnoh ikpi amohnoh kate nyi nnoh na amoh</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="2CO 6:17">Ada a bleh la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">Kama bara nnoh andromboh ata nza a bu na zanana kpeh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">tasa meh nati sa nnoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />&lt;&lt;Meh nati bu Ada amohnoh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">tasa mohnoh za ni nati bu noh mara amya mboh tasa nyifa amya mboh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">Ada agba nza a bu na wuwana nambri reh a bleh dehreh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Iziza amya mboh ata mya nza meh kira na amoh, tsifa la tama a bleh reh tsifa amboh ata areh a gya reh, ba nnoh meh ti lisa ikpi ambohroh nyi ma andromboh ata a nati de reh a chakafa. Ba nnoh meh ti tuma amboh zanana fyafya mboh nimeh nyiri Nnoh.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Johjoh Ablusu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Vuru nnoh agohsoh amohnoh mboh na ambohroh, mbohroh meh kama hwa aniye ma akyo kpeh, meh kputu akyo kpeh, ha la meh ti rya akyo kpeh. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />Meh sohroh bleh noh ata areh la meh ti tsana la ni lisa noh andromboh abibi kpeh. Tswanza mya ti kǝ jiji bleh noh na amehmeh reh la, ni bu noh ajija kyangwri mboh na ambohroh, Meh kira na amohnoh gaga, nyi ma agohsoh ambohroh, ni kǝ bu noh na ambohroh ni tutu. Tasa ha bu nimeh kwo ha nimeh fene. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Meh kira na amohnoh gaga, meh va ivoh agohsoh na amohnoh. Agohsoh amya a bu na a wuwana gaga. Ni iya nza meh kǝ wa, agohsoh amya bu nimeh a kasa gaga.<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />Na ameh ata meh ti kǝ ba Makidoniya, timi hunji fo kpeh. ha meh na ma maka a wa reh aniye ma inziyo maka a fa reh na akpi, nyiri ka a de reh gaga ma agohsoh ambohroh. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Nnoh neh, ata nza nga wuwana itoh ma akyo ata agohsoh a ŋoh nza kǝ kate, nga wuwana itoh na ba Titus, <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />tasa za la bu na ba Titus tsene kpeh, tasa za neh la bu na nga wuwana itoh ata nza a hunji na amohnoh. A bleh reh nza ni kya nnoh iyo ti nza meh noh, tasa agohsoh amohnoh nza a kputuna ma ikpi andromboh nza a te, tasa nza ni shi wuwana nnoh reh nza ni shi meh noh ma nyina. A bu wohroh mya nza ni nza nana gaga. <verse eid="2CO 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Ha amgbasho amya reh a kputu nnoh agohsoh a wa meh aniye kpeh, na amehmeh tana a wa meh aniye la amgbasho mya reh ka a kputu nnoh agohsoh, tana ka a gu ameh shidi ma. <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />Nehnehreh neh a nana meh agohsoh, bu tsifa la amgbasho amya a kputu nnoh agohsoh kpeh, uwa, neh a bu tsifa la nza a kputu nnoh agohsoh gaga nza ni gyuruna sehnehna nnoh agohsoh amohnoh mboh. kputu agohsoh amohnoh reh a bu ika ata agohsoh Nnoh, andromboh ata nasana anyi na ambohroh kpeh. <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Kputu agohsoh ma aki ata Nnoh nza a kira ka a de kyangwri ta a gyuruna ata aki agugu a ŋoh, a ba ni Nnoh, ma aki wohroh a nati a hunji nvara. tasa rya ameh ivoh a nati yama nimeh kpeh. Kputu agohsoh ata kyangwri nza a de a ba a ka a gu a na akyo ta a kwo. <verse eid="2CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Nza nnoh andromboh kputu agohsoh ata Nnoh nza a fi ma agohsoh amohnoh mboh nza a de noh a lisa reh, ni kohnoh nnoh alindeh, a de noh a te la ni kira tsana noh gaga la ti gyuruna ta nnoh aki abibi amohnoh mboh reh a de noh a te ti bu noh gofo ma, tasa ni kǝ nyiri nnoh, tasa ni gya noh agohsoh ti sehnehna nnoh. A de noh a te ti kira nnoh ti lisa nnoh andromboh ata nza a keh zohhoh. <verse eid="2CO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Na ameh ata meh ti kǝ ŋa amgbasho ata ari ba nnoh reh, tana a wa meh aniye kpeh na kyangwri ata nza a kpakpana, ha kyangwri ata nza ma a kputu ŋoh agohsoh kpeh. Neh meh tini ŋa meh ti bleh noh pelele la Nnoh a wina ni kira nnoh na ambohroh gaga. <verse eid="2CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Tsifa mbohroh nza meh hunji wuwana ma agohsoh ambohroh mboh. kembese za, Ma nyina wuwana agohsoh ambohroh reh, ma lisa hunji nana agohsoh a keh nza meh nza Titus nza a bu na nana agohsoh a ŋoh, tsifa la huru a ŋoh kǝ lisa keh te afeh nyi nambri ma amohnoh <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Meh tini va ivoh agohsoh ma ikpi amohnoh na Titus, tasa ni sohroh nga meh noh sa kpeh. Mbohroh neh meh kǝ bleh noh zizi ma na tutu, va ivoh ambohroh ma agohsoh ma ikpi amohnoh ni Titus reh a tsana zizi za. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Kira ata Titus nza a kira na amohnoh reh ka a lisa a keh gaga nza a kohnoh la na nga noh ikpi amohnoh nambri, tasa biroh nga agba nza ni tsana noh na ameh ata ti kǝ sa nnoh reh. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />Meh bu na nana agohsoh la meh kira na amohnoh gaga ma a zizi.<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ngǝnga Ata amboh Tufa Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />ambohroh mboh, mbohroh meh kira ti wina noh andromboh alindeh ata Nnoh nza a lisa ma amboh tufa mboh nza ma a yama ma Makidoniya reh. <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />Mboh reh ma a nza iya gaga la iya ata mboh nza ma a bu nimeh reh a kama a keh, nana agohsoh amoh nza bu gaga reh, maka a leh a lisa alindeh atsi leh ngǝnga ma mgbiri mboh nza ma a bu nimeh iya agba. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Mya meh wina la ma a de ngǝnga amoh a ba a tswa na wuwana amoh, a gyuru a keh wuwana amoh za. Ma a de ba na agohsoh amoh anyimbehreh, ma a de mboh na wuwana kpeh. <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />Ma a kwere reh a wuwana la meh ti nga mboh aki mata a shingi kyangwri mboh, la mboh za isa amoh ta a hunji niye nimeh amboh ata ma a leh a shingi amboh tufa yehlehleh nza ma A yama ma Yahuda reh. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Ma a gyuru a lisa a gǝga a handa andromboh ata mbohroh meh gya agohsoh ambohroh ma ikpi reh, ma a jiji nga ikpi amoh ma Ada, nza anyi ma a huru za maka nga reh ikpi amoh na kira Nnoh. <verse eid="2CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Nza meh kǝ nza dehreh, meh kǝ kwere Titus la ta rya tohmoh na ndohmoh sa awumu mboh nza ma a leh a de ba na agohsoh anyimbehreh reh a dohdohsoh, la bu ŋoh tana a jiji. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Nimeh awumu mboh reh nambri, ni bu noh ma tohmoh, nimeh nga agohsoh amohnoh ma Kristi, nimeh tsifa amohnoh, nimeh lomo, ha nimeh wina ndohmoh tasa nimeh kira ata ni bu noh na wohroh na ambohroh, a bu tsifa wohroh mbohroh nza meh bleh la ti rya nnoh tohmoh na ndohmoh alindeh reh.<verse eid="2CO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />Mya meh de noh na wuwana kpeh, meh leh tsana noh ika ata mgbiri mboh nza ma a leh a te ndohmoh reh na agohsoh anyimbehreh. Ata areh a nati tsara biroh kira ata ni bu noh na wohroh reh. <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />mohnoh ni wina noh lisa alindeh ata Ada ambohroh Yeso Kristi nza a bu na wohroh reh. Ŋoh tana a bu na awumu mboh reh nambri ma inza, a de ikpi a ŋoh a te tswanza kyangwri iya la ŋoh ta a shingi nnoh, la ŋoh nza a bu na iya reh mohnoh ti hunji noh awumu mboh reh nambri ma tohmoh Nnoh.<verse eid="2CO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Tsifa ata meh nati bleh noh reh a bu la, a nati a keh zohhoh ti tre nnoh ndohmoh ata ti kǝ jiji nnoh ahushi ata gǝga reh, a bu la ni nga bu noh kpeh, mohnoh neh ni bu noh na kira. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />nehnehreh, tre nnoh ndohmoh na biroh agohsoh ata ti kǝ jiji nnoh reh, lisa nnoh ata ni nati wina lisa nnoh reh. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Nza ni bu noh na agohsoh ngǝnga reh, Nnoh a nati a nza nana ngǝnga reh, nza ni nga bu noh andromboh ata ni bu noh na wohroh reh. Nnoh a kira ti lisa nnoh andromboh ata nza a nati a keh wuwana amohnoh kpeh reh.<verse eid="2CO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />A bu kira amya la mgbiri kyangwri mata a hunji kukuna, mohnoh neh ti wa nnoh iya kpeh, awumu mboh reh neh ta bu yehlehleh. <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />nehnehreh, mohnoh na ikpi amohnoh ni bu noh na wohroh gaga, mohnoh za ti nga nnoh ma amboh ata ma a bu na wohroh gaga kpeh reh. Nza a gyuru a gu a na ma tohmoh shidi, mboh za tama a hunji gaga reh, ma a nati a wina gyuru nga nnoh za. Ma a nati a wina shingi nnoh nza ni bu noh na wohroh gaga kpeh reh, ma a nati a shingi nnoh tswanza nza ni shingi mboh nnoh za reh, ma aki wohroh reh awumu a nati ka bu yehlehleh, <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />tswanza nza ma a ŋa nimeh amgbasho Nnoh reh la, &lt;&lt;Akyo ata nza a fira a gya ma akpo anyimbehreh gaga, a nati a hunji gaga kpeh, tasa za akyo ata nza a fira a gya shidi ma reh, a nati a hunji shidi kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ma A tohmoh Titus A na Korintiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />Meh kwende ma Nnoh nza nga ma Titus agohsoh kira ta a shingi nnoh reh, tswanza mya nza ni kira reh. <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Titus reh a kira ta a ba na amohnoh la mbohroh meh kwere ŋoh kpeh, ŋoh neh a ba na amohnoh na kira agohsoh a ŋoh. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />Mbohroh meh tohmoh atohngoh ambohroh kyangwri tufa anyi mboh ma Titus. amboh tufa mboh reh nambri ma leh a bleh tsifa alilehndeh ma ikpi kyangwri reh. Ma a wina ŋoh ma atsi bleh tsifa nana Yeso Kristi reh ma duma mboh. <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />A bu tsifa wohroh ma tsene kpeh, amboh tufa mboh tama a seh ŋoh la ta a leh a wa reh a hehndeh, ma a kira ta a shingi reh ma atsi de ngǝnga amohnoh reh na. Ma a kira la ta a shingi reh te ndohmoh ma Nnoh, mbohroh meh lisa timi tsana agba Nnoh tasa alindeh ŋoh. Meh lisa dehreh za la timi shingi kyangwri mboh. <verse eid="2CO 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />Mbohroh meh leh gbo la akyo ta a kama a kya reh ma atsi gafa ngǝnga ata nza ma nga reh na agohsoh anyimbehreh reh kpeh. <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />A bu kira ambohroh meh ti lisa awumu ata nza bu yehlehleh, a bu ma tohmoh Ada tsene kpeh, tasa ma tohmoh kyangwri mboh za.<verse eid="2CO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Mbohroh meh tohmoh atohngoh ambohroh anyi za mboh ma amoh, lo vara, ma akeki mboh ma atsetse, ka a yoyona la ŋoh a kira ta a shingi kyangwri mboh gaga. Tasa nehnehreh za ŋoh kǝ wina noh, a kira ta a shingi nnoh za. <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />mohnoh kohnoh nza noh la mbohroh meh te ndohmoh mbohroh ma Titus, mbohroh ma ŋoh meh te ndohmoh reh tsifa amohnoh, mgbiri ambohroh mboh ata ma bu ma a ŋoh reh, a bu duma amboh tufa mboh ma a tohmoh mboh, ndohmoh amoh ka a de nga agba a ba ma Kristi. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Nza a bu dehreh, tsana noh ma kyangwri mboh reh la ni kira nnoh na amoh, duma amboh tufa mboh amboh ata ma a tohmoh mboh reh, ma a nati a nza nana andromboh ata ni lisa noh reh, ata areh a nati a tsana mboh la va ivoh ma agohsoh ambohroh ma ikpi amohnoh reh a bu zizi.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />Areh a bu andromboh la mya ti za leh ŋa ba nnoh ma ikpi hungroh ata mata tohmoh a na mata a shingi kyangwri Nnoh mboh. <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />Mya meh wina la ni bu noh na agohsoh kira ti shingi mboh nnoh. Meh kǝ leh va ivoh ma agohsoh na amohnoh na kyangwri Makidoniya mboh ma ikpi lisa dehreh, meh kǝ bleh mboh la mohnoh kyangwri Akaya mboh ni suhru nnoh ikpi amohnoh bana nnoh nyi na ahushi ata nza na a gǝga. biroh yiyina ata nza ni bu noh na wohroh ka a de mboh a te mboh za maka a hinga ka a shi na a hwana. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Neh meh buti tohmoh atsi ambohroh Titus tasa amboh afri anyi ba na amohnoh. La va ivoh ambohroh ma agohsoh na amohnoh reh ta a kama bu wusu kpeh, la neh ti suhru ikpi amohnoh ba nnoh, tswanza mya nza ni bleh ma ikpi amohnoh reh la ni nati lisa nnoh. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />Tsifa la nza meh ba Mbohroh ma amboh tufa mboh amboh anyi nyi Makidoniya, meh kira la mata a ba ba a hunji noh la ni sohroh suhru nnoh ikpi amohnoh kpeh, a nati te meh na sa nza ta a bu dehreh, tsifa la meh leh va ivoh agohsoh ma ikpi amohnoh, a bu mya tsimya a nati te meh na sa kpeh a nati te nnoh mohnoh za. <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Meh nza la a zohhoh meh ti kwere atsi mboh mata a jiji a ba feh meh si ba na ikpi amya. La mata a suhru awumu ata ti kǝ bleh gya nnoh la ni nati de ba nnoh reh, la mata a ba ba a hunji mboh ma akpo anyimbehreh. Areh a nati tsana la ni de ba nnoh na kira agohsoh amohnoh anyimbehreh, ma a de noh na wuwana kpeh.<verse eid="2CO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Biya Awumu Na Agohsoh Anyimbehreh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Kohnoh nnoh ata areh: Akyo ata nza a biya biroh shidi a nati a fasa a hunji shidi ma, tasa akyo ata nza a biya biroh gaga a nati a fasa a hunji gaga za. <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Akyo ta nga andromboh ata nza a gu ma agohsoh a ŋoh, ta a kputu agohsoh a ŋoh ha la ma a de ŋoh na wuwana kpeh, la Nnoh ka a kira amboh ngǝnga na agohsoh amoh anyimbehreh. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Tasa Nnoh ka a wina te nnoh atoh keh andromboh ata nza ni kira, tsifa ha na mboh ni nati hunji andromboh ata nza ni kira nnoh, a nati a gǝga a keh dehreh, la ni lisa ndohmoh ata nza a zohhoh. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />Tswanza ma ta ka a ŋa reh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">&lt;&lt;A vuru ivoh a ŋoh a nga ma amboh nza ma a bu na wohroh kpeh;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 9:9">Lisa alindeh a ŋoh a nati a tuma atono.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />A bu Nnoh mi a ka a nga ma kyangwri biya biroh ta a biya, ta a nga ŋoh rya za. Tsifa wohroh reh Nnoh a nati a nga noh biroh ata ni nati biya nnoh, a bu ŋoh mi a nati a de biroh reh ta a te agba. A bu ma aki wohroh za a nati a de ngǝnga amohnoh na agohsoh anyimbehreh ta lisa a keh te atoh nimeh ndohmoh amohnoh ata nza a zohhoh. <verse eid="2CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />Nnoh a nati nga nnoh asabara nimeh awumu mboh nambri la ti bu noh amboh ngǝnga mboh na agohsoh anyimbehreh na tutu. Ma aki wohroh kyangwri mboh gaga ma a nati kwende Nnoh tsifa ngǝnga.<verse eid="2CO 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />Ndohmoh alindeh ata areh nza ni lisa noh reh a sohroh a shi ma ikpi shingi amboh te ndohmoh Nnoh tsene kpeh, a lisa a de kyangwri mboh mata a nga kwende ma Nnoh. <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />Tsifa la ngǝnga amohnoh reh a nati tsana ha ni bu lele. Ni bleh la ni nga agohsoh ma tsifa nana ma ikpi Yeso Kristi. Tasa ngǝnga anzoh a nati tsana ha a bu lele ni kira ti nga agba ma Nnoh. <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />Tasa nimeh kwere Nnoh amoh ma ikpi amohnoh agohsoh amoh a nati kohnoh nnoh tsifa andromboh alindeh ata nza ni lisa mboh nnoh a keh gaga a gǝga ata Nnoh nza a nga noh reh. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />Mbohroh meh kwende ma Nnoh tsifa ngǝnga ata aniye a nati a wina bleh kpeh!<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Ablusu A bleh Tsifa A shwa Ndohmoh A ŋoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />Mya Ablusu meh kwere nnoh na kuku ikpi ika ata Yeso Kristi, amboh anyi nimeh amohnoh ma a bleh la nza meh yama na amohnoh meh kǝ &lt;&lt;kuku ikpi&gt;&gt; neh meh kǝ bu na &lt;&lt;wuwa agohsoh&gt;&gt; nza meh sohroh yama na amohnoh kpeh! <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />Meh kwere nnoh la, kama lisa meh noh meh ti bu kyangwri wuwa agohsoh nza mya tini ba na amohnoh reh, meh ti wuwa agohsoh tswanza mya nza ni tswa ti bu ma ikpi amboh ata nza ma kohnoh la meh tuma ika ata inziyo reh. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Mbohroh meh tuma ma inziyo dehreh neh, meh sohroh lisa ika ata inziyo areh kpeh. <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />Awumu mlana gofo ambohroh a sohroh a bu ika ata inziyo areh kpeh. Neh, a bu ata wuwana Nnoh mi ata druhu wuwana mboh. <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />Meh druhu keh na aniye mboh tasa andromboh ata nza a nati a ha wina Nnoh, tasa meh de kohnoh mboh nambri la mata a tufa Kristi. <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />Tasa meh nati hwa amboh ata nza ma leke tufa, nza tufa amohnoh kǝ su.<verse eid="2CO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />mohnoh ni leh nza noh ata nza a bu ma inziyo ma. Nza akyo a bu na agohsoh anyimbehreh la ŋoh a bu Kristi a ŋoh, ta a kohnoh la Mbohroh za meh bu Kristi a ŋoh tswanza ŋoh reh za. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />Nza meh rya itoh ma ikpi wuwana ata Ada nza a nga reh la meh ti mina nnoh ka, a sohroh a bu ata kpi nnoh tamba kpeh, meh nati sohroh kwo isa na wohroh kpeh. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />Meh sohroh kira ta a bu tswanza meh kira meh ti leh nga nnoh nyiri na amgbasho amya mboh kpeh. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Mgbiri amohnoh amboh anyi ma a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Amgbasho a ŋoh mboh reh ka a bu ata wuwana, tasa neh nza a yama na ambohroh na ikpi a ŋoh, ŋoh a sohroh a bu kyangwri tsifa na wuwana kpeh tasa tsifa a ŋoh a sohroh a bu andromboh kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />Kyangwri amboh wohroh mata wina la andromboh ata Mbohroh nza meh bu nimeh amgbasho ambohroh nza meh sohroh yama kpeh, a nati a bu dehreh za nza meh yama.<verse eid="2CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Mbohroh meh sohroh tsara ikpi ambohroh na kyangwri amboh ata nza ma va ivoh agohsoh amoh kpeh. Nza ma tsara ikpi amoh na ikpi amoh mata tsara ikpi amoh na ikpi amoh, ma a sohroh a bu na lomo kpeh. <verse eid="2CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Mbohroh, neh, meh nati sohroh rya itoh gǝga handa kpeh, neh meh nati shi ma hohnoh ata Nnoh nza a nga reh, ata nza a dohsoh na amohnoh za. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Mbohroh meh sohroh rya itoh gǝga handa kpeh, nza meh de tsifa nana ata Yeso Kristi ba na amohnoh. <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />Ha meh rya itoh gǝga handa ma ikpi ndohmoh ata amboh tswa nza ma a te kpeh. Gya agohsoh ambohroh a bu la, nza nga agohsoh amohnoh a bu nimeh rya tohmoh, akeki ndohmoh ambohroh nimeh amohnoh a nati ka a vuruna gaga, <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />la meh ti hunji bleh tsifa nana Yeso reh gǝga handa kpra Agohmoh amohnoh. Mbohroh meh sohroh kira meh ti rya itoh ma ikpi ndohmoh ata nza ma a te nimeh atsifi ata nza ma a gya ŋoh. <verse eid="2CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />Neh, amgbasho Nnoh a bleh la &lt;&lt;Ta ata nza a rya itoh ta a rya itoh nimeh Ada.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />A sohroh a bu kyangwri ata nza a ka ava ivoh agohsoh ŋa maka a kira na a ŋoh kpeh, a bu ata Ada nza a bleh alindeh ma ikpi a ŋoh mi.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="s">Ablusu Mboh Ma amboh Tufa Yeso Ata Huru Tsifa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />Meh gya agohsoh la ni nati soh nnoh ivoh yira na duduna amya reh shidi; mohnoh ni kǝ soh nnoh ivoh yira na amya. <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />Meh te vene na amohnoh, vene ika ata Nnoh, mohnoh ni bu noh tswanza anyifa ata kǝ hehreh wina atsifa nza kpeh, nza ma a nati a wa a na ida atsifa anyimbehreh tsene, wohroh reh a bu Kristi na ikpi a ŋoh. <verse eid="2CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Mya meh nyiri la agohsoh amohnoh ta kama a te abibi tasa la ti kama ta nnoh aki nga ikpi amohnoh ma Yeso Kristi tswanza iyo ta ka a landa Hawawu na huru tsifa a ŋoh reh kpeh. <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Nza akyo anyi a ba na amohnoh ta a ba ba bleh noh tsifa Yeso anyi tse, a sohroh a bu Yeso ata Mbohroh nza meh bleh noh reh kpeh, ha nza ni sa nnoh huru anyi tse, ha tsifa nana anyi tse na ata nza ni nga nnoh agohsoh reh. <verse eid="2CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />amboh tsana wohroh ma a fi ikpi amoh la &lt;&lt;amboh sa tsifa nana bleh alindeh ŋoh.&gt;&gt;Mya neh meh nza la meh bu alindeh tswanza mboh reh za! <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Ha meh sohroh kira ma aki tsifa kpeh, neh meh sohroh nyina ma lomo kpeh. mbohroh meh tsana noh sese ma akeki mboh nambri.<verse eid="2CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />Nza meh tsana noh tsifa Nnoh reh, meh sohroh luhu nnoh fanga kpeh, meh de ikpi amya tamba la mohnoh ti keh meh noh. <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />amboh tufa mboh ma akpokpo atsifi ma nga meh hungroh meh ti ba bu te noh ndohmoh na wohroh. <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />Meh ti kǝ bu na amohnoh nimeh iya, meh sohroh luhu nnoh andromboh kpeh, amboh tufa nza ma anyi akpo afya Makidoniya reh ma a de awumu ata nza meh kira a ba meh. Meh sohroh de noh te iya kpeh tasa za meh nati rya tohmoh dehreh. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />Meh bleh noh zizi Kristi ata nza a bu nimeh amya, meh gu fa aku la rya itoh amya ata areh a nati a sohroh a shimba ma akpokpo afiyafiya Akaya mboh nambri kpeh. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />Meh bleh dehreh tsifa umbo? La ta tsana la meh sohroh kira na amohnoh kpeh? Nnoh a wina la meh kira na amohnoh. <verse eid="2CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />Meh nati kǝ rya tohmoh na lisa dehreh la kyangwri mboh mata kama a rya itoh la mboh za ma lisa ika ambohroh reh kpeh. <verse eid="2CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Kyangwri amboh wohroh ma a bu amboh ble tsifa nana ata huru tsifa tasa amboh te ndohmoh ata nza ma a sohroh a bu na zizi ma aniye kpeh, ma a zaka a kyehnehna ma la mboh ma a bu amboh sa tsifa nana Yeso a bleh. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Meh wina ma a tswanza agugu nza a ka a kyehnehna a te tswanza Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ata zanana reh. <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Dehreh a sohroh a bu andromboh agba kpeh nza ahwra a ŋoh mboh ma a kyehnehna a te tswanza ahwra amboh zanana mboh. Trina amoh a nati a tswa na agugu amoh.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ablusu A rya Itoh Na Wa Iya A ŋoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />Meh gyuru bleh za la akyo ta kama a nza la mya meh bu duduna kpeh. Nza ni nza noh dehreh, sa meh noh tswanza duduna reh dehreh, la mya ti rya itoh shidi. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />Andromboh ata mya nza ni bleh nimeh rya itoh areh, a sohroh a bu tsifa ata Ada nza a nati a tsana meh kpeh, a zaka a bu duduna amya ma. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Nza kyangwri mboh ma rya itoh ma ikpi andromboh ata mboh nza ma a lisa ika ata inziyo, mya za meh nati rya itoh ika wohroh. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />mohnoh ni bu noh na lomo, ni kǝ nza noh kwini duduna mboh. <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />mohnoh ni kǝ soh nnoh ivoh yira na akyo ata nza a de noh a te ahwra, ta hwana awumu amohnoh, mata mla nnoh ma tohmoh. <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />A te meh na isa ma aki bleh la mbohroh meh sohroh wuwana aki lisa dehreh kpeh!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Andromboh ata nza ma a rya itoh ma ikpi ŋoh neh, meh gyuru tsifa tswanza duduna za meh nati rya itoh ma ikpi ŋoh za. <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />Mboh ma a bu Yahudawa umbo? mya za meh bu alohsoh wohroh. Ma a bu mara Ibrahim umbo? mya za meh bu amehreh Ibrahim. Ma a bu alohsoh Ibrahim? Mya za meh bu dehreh za. <verse eid="2CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />Ma a bu ahwra Kristi umbo? Mya za meh te ahwra Kristi keh mboh! &lt;&lt;Nehnehreh meh tsifa tswanza kyangwri a kwere.&gt;&gt; Meh te ndohmoh keh mboh tasa ma a de meh a ka ma ida ka a te hwana vara a keh mboh, ma a mla meh gaga a keh mboh, meh ba whiri na kwo a hwana vara. <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Kyangwri amya Yahudawa mboh ma mla meh na amviri 39 a te na atungu. <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />Romawa mboh ma a mla meh na ikpoh a te na atatoh, ichi anyi ma a dafa meh na kpakpa, gbogblondo amwo a vasana a te na atatoh mya nimeh, meh tuma ma fini akre a wa shini, <verse eid="2CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />Nimeh hende amya meh te iya ma amwo tasa ma ivoh ayuhu mboh, tasa ma ivoh kyangwri amya mboh tasa amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh; meh te iya ma akpokpo afiyafiya agbugba tasa nimeh bini meh te iya ma fini akre; meh te iya ma ivoh amboh ata nza ma a huru la mboh ma a bu amboh tufa mboh. <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />Meh te ndohmoh gaga tasa meh leh mla nashi ni kpeh; Meh te iya na nyo tasa yohroh amwo tasa za meh sohroh bu na awumu rya kpeh; Meh te iya kuri awo ka a te meh gaga. <verse eid="2CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />A bu wohroh tsene kpeh, meh kǝ te iya ibibi tsifa kohnoh na amboh tufa mboh ma akpokpo atsifi. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Nza akyo anyi a kohoh, neh itoh amya za ka a kwo, a bu anyi a kpakpana neh ka a sohroh a wa meh aniye kpeh?<verse eid="2CO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Nza meh nati rya itoh, a bu tsifa nyinana amya. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Nnoh tasa Ada ata Yeso, ŋoh nza a bu na te atoh tasa riri ata tuma atono, a wina la meh sohroh huru tsifa kpeh. <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />Meh ti kǝ bu ma Damasku, Agohmoh ata gomnati ata nza a te ndohmoh na Agohmoh Areh ta ka a hama akeki niye na akpo afya reh la mata a de meh a tsitsiya. <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />Mya neh meh kǝ gǝga nvara, ziza amya mboh tama a gu meh a fi ma akwri maka a gu meh a gǝga ma avu anyi a ka a te.<verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Ablusu A nza Ma Huru Tasa Wa Iya A ŋoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Meh nati rya itoh kanga, meh wina la a zaka a bu wusu ma, neh meh nati tsifa ma ikpi nza Ma huru ata Ada nza a vuru a tsana meh tasa awumu ata huho ŋoh reh. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Ahushi agrumavoh a hwa aniye nza a gǝga meh wina kyangwri tufa Yeso anyi tama a gu ŋoh a ka a na ma inza ma atsi ata Nnoh nza a yama. Meh sohroh wina kpeh ha kyangwri reh tana a treh a bu ma itoh a ŋoh ta ka a bu dehreh reh, Nnoh tsene a wina. <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3" />Meh wina la kyangwri ata areh tama a gu ŋoh a ka a na inza ha tana a bu na itoh a ŋoh ha a bu Ma huru mi, Nnoh tsene ka a wina, <verse eid="2CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" />meh wina la tama afya kyangwri reh a gu a ka a na inza ma atsi tuma Nnoh ka a sehreh tsifa amboh ata nza a sohroh a bu na bleh kpeh. <verse eid="2CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />Meh nati rya itoh ma ikpi kyangwri ika wohroh, neh meh nati sohroh rya itoh na ikpi amya kpeh, meh nati rya itoh ma ikpi andromboh ata nza a tsana nyinana amya. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Nza meh nati rya itoh kembese, meh nati sohroh duduna kpeh, meh nati bleh tsifa a zizi. Mya neh meh nati sohroh bleh tsifa alindeh ma ikpi amya kpeh, meh kira la kyangwri mboh mata kohnoh alindeh ma ikpi amya, la kyangwri mata a nza hende amya mata kohnoh alindeh ma ikpi tsifa amya.<verse eid="2CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />La meh ti kama rya itoh ma ikpi awumu agbugba ata Nnoh nza a vuru a tsana meh reh kpeh, maka a fi meh bishi anyi nza a tswanza atohtoh ma itoh amya nza anyi na agugu la ta ka a de meh a te iya. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />Meh kwere Nnoh te na atatoh la rina reh ta a trina meh. <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />Nnoh neh ka a bleh meh la, &lt;&lt;kwini amya ta a tswa nnoh, wuwana amya a ka a keh tsana nimeh nyinana.&gt;&gt; Nza a bu dehreh meh nati rya itoh nimeh nza iya amya, la wuwana Kristi reh ta ka a hunji rya tohmoh nimeh amya. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Ka a bu dehreh meh kǝ hunji wuwa itoh nimeh nyinana amya reh, tasa kya, tasa iya, ma ikpi Kristi. Nza meh nyinana neh, meh kǝ wuwana.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ablusu A kohnoh Korintiyawa Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />mohnoh ni de meh noh tsifa tswanza duduna. A zohhoh mohnoh ni ikpi amohnoh ti tsifa nnoh alindeh ma ikpi amya, meh tini sohroh bu akehreh nimeh &lt;&lt;Agbugba amboh sa tohmoh nana Yeso a bleh reh &gt;&gt; Ma a sohroh a keh meh kpeh. <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Meh ti kǝ bu na amohnoh reh, meh te ndohmoh agbugba na soh ivoh yira tsana la mya meh bu kyangwri sa tsifa nana Yeso a bleh ata a zizi ŋoh. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />A ka a bu ma aki atamaa mya nza ni sohroh ta nnoh ti lisa meh noh ika ata mgbiri amboh tufa mboh ma akpokpo afiyafiya mboh reh kpeh? meh sohroh ta nnoh ti shingi meh noh ni hungroh kpeh, soh meh noh ivoh yira.<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Meh ba whiri meh ti ba na amohnoh a hwa na na atatoh nehnehreh, Neh meh nati sohroh de noh te iya kpeh, a sohroh a bu tsifa asabara amohnoh ŋa mya nza ni ba kpeh a bu tsifa amohnoh mi. Amehreh mboh maka a sohroh a nza iya ma ikpi alehmeh amoh mboh kpeh a ka a bu alehmeh amoh mboh mi maka a nza iya ma ikpi mara amoh mboh. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />Meh nati nza nana mya ti tre awumu amya nambri tasa ikpi amya ma ikpi amohnoh, ni nati kira meh noh shidi ma la mya meh kǝ kira na amohnoh gaga? <verse eid="2CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />mohnoh na ikpi amohnoh ni wina noh la ni sohroh nza noh iya ma ikpi amya kpeh. Neh, mgbiri amohnoh ma a bleh la mya meh kyehnehna leh hwana hungroh nyi na amohnoh! <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />amboh ata mya ti kǝ tohmoh ba na amohnoh reh anyi tana a hwana andromboh anyi na amohnoh? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />Mya meh kwere Titus ta a na na amohnoh, meh tohmoh atsi ambohroh anyi nimeh amboh tufa Yeso ta a wa ŋoh. Titus reh tana a hwana andromboh anyi na amohnoh? Uwa na afri ma ambohroh meh te ndohmoh na huru anyimbehreh tasa meh te ndohmoh anyimbehreh. <verse eid="2CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Nza ni leh kohnoh nnoh la meh zakǝ tsifa shwa ikpi ambohroh ma, wohroh ni kpakpana nnoh, uwa! Mbohroh meh tsifa tswanza kyangwri amboh ata nza ma a bu Kristi a ŋoh; iziza mboh meh tsifa dehreh la ta a shingi nnoh mi. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Mya meh nyiri la mya ti ba meh nati hunji noh yehlehleh tswanza agohsoh amya nza a kira reh kpeh, meh nyiri la mya ti ba meh nati hunji noh ti were gohroh, tasa te vene, tasa hungwa agohsoh, tasa kira ikpi, tasa kputu isa, tsifa ma ikpi kyangwri, tasa gu ikpi ka, tasa chakafana. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />Meh nyiri la nza meh gyuru ba na amohnoh Nnoh amya a nati a nga meh na isa ma tohmoh amohnoh, tasa meh nati kpanga ma ikpi amboh ata nza ma a kpakpana ma jiji ŋoh reh tasa maka a sohroh a gyuruna anyi ma chakafana ata hende leh ahohndoh reh kpeh.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="s1">Kpi Ashotoh Ata Trina Ŋoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />Meh nati ba na amohnoh ichi ata na atatoh. Amgbasho Nnoh a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri afri ha atatoh ma a nati a bleh tsifa ma ikpi akyo kanga feh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Meh tini kpi ashotoh ma amboh kpakpana mboh mya ti kǝ ba na amohnoh ichi ata na afri ŋoh reh. Meh gyuru bleh noh na afri za mya nza ni sohroh yama kpeh areh: nehnehreh meh gyuru kpi nnoh ashotoh za nza meh gyuru ba akyo anyi a nati a sohroh anvara ma ivoh amya kpeh, <verse eid="2CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />areh a nati a tsana noh la a bu kristi a buti tsifa nimeh amya. Kristi reh a tsana wuwana a ŋoh nimeh amohnoh, neh wuwana a sohroh anyina ŋoh kpeh. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Tama a mla Kristi reh a kwo ma gbohrohgboh nimeh kwini, a bu wuwana Nnoh ŋa a nga ŋoh fene. Dehreh za, Mbohroh nza meh bu na wuwana kpeh ma aki a ŋoh, dehreh meh bu na fene nimeh a ŋoh ma tsifa ndohmoh ata nza meh te nimeh amohnoh reh.<verse eid="2CO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Tsara nnoh ikpi amohnoh te nza noh ha nga agohsoh amohnoh na Kristi reh a bu ata a zizi. Nza ni rya nnoh tsara reh, ni nati wina noh la Kristi reh a bu na amohnoh, nza ni hwa nnoh tsara reh a tsana la Kristi a sohroh a bu na amohnoh kpeh. <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />Mya meh wina ni nati nza wina noh la mbohroh meh sohroh hwa tsara reh kpeh. <verse eid="2CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Mbohroh meh sohroh kwere Nnoh la mohnoh ti lisa nnoh andromboh ata nza a bu abibi kpeh. Mbohroh meh sohroh kwere Nnoh la ti nza noh la Mbohroh meh bu alindeh kpeh neh meh lisa dehreh la mohnoh ti lisa nnoh andromboh ata nza a bu alindeh. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Mbohroh meh nati sohroh lisa andromboh anyi ata nza a leke na tsifa a zizi kpeh, meh nati shi ma ikpi lisa andromboh ata nza a bu zizi. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />Mbohroh meh nza nana nza meh sohroh bu na wuwana kpeh la mohnoh ti bu noh ni wuwana; mbohroh meh kwere Nnoh la mohnoh ti bu noh yehlehleh ma aki Nnoh. <verse eid="2CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />A bu tsifa wohroh reh mya nza ni bleh noh ma amgbasho mya nza ni sohroh yama kpeh nehnehreh, la mya tini ba neh meh ti kama te gofo na amohnoh wuwana ata Nnoh nza a nga meh reh kpeh, a bu wuwana ata de rya tohmoh ba a sohroh a bu ata de druhuna a ba kpeh.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsifa Ata Trina Ŋoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Atsi ambohroh ma asra amya mboh, meh ta nnoh alindeh. Fa noh akeki ti bu noh alindeh, nga nnoh itoh amohnoh wuwana, tuma noh alindeh. Nnoh ata nza a bu ata kira tasa tuma alindeh a nati a bu na amohnoh.<verse eid="2CO 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Nza ni dohsohna nnoh, tsifa de noh itoh amohnoh ni kira alindeh ika ata amboh tufa mboh. <verse eid="2CO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Kyangwri Nnoh mboh ni mareh ma atsifa na amohnoh nambri.<verse eid="2CO 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 13:14" />Meh kwere Nnoh la kira alindeh ata Ada Yeso Kristi, tasa kira ata Nnoh, tasa dohsoh ikpi ata huru zanana ta a bu na amohnoh nambri.<verse eid="2CO 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>